{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":872140,"duration_api_ms":999686,"num_turns":92,"result":"Now let me produce the final JSON output:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"change_summary\": \"Added root-zone oxygenation (radial oxygen loss / ROL) hooks connecting rooted plant biomass to substrate O₂ penetration depth. A new named parameter `rol_rate_cm_per_g` (default 0.15 cm/g) in ProcessParams controls the marginal O₂ penetration bonus per gram of root biomass. The effective bonus uses a sqrt saturation model: `bonus = sqrt(root_biomass_g) × rol_rate_cm_per_g`, which is added to the Bouldin-model base penetration depth. Only RootFeedingRosette guilds contribute; FastStem (water-column feeders) produce zero bonus. The root oxygenation contribution is exposed via tracing::debug! structured logging, pool snapshot tracking (substrate.root_oxygenation_bonus_cm, substrate.o2_penetration_depth_cm), and engine stage metrics on the system:substrate_zones stage.\",\n  \"steps\": [\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Add `rol_rate_cm_per_g` named parameter to ProcessParams with serde default, doc comment citing ROL literature, and default value function (0.15 cm/g) in crates/tank_core/src/types/process.rs\",\n      \"order\": 1,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Implement `root_oxygenation_bonus_cm()` public function in crates/tank_core/src/systems/substrate.rs using sqrt(rooted_biomass_g) × rol_rate for diminishing returns, filtering only RootFeedingRosette guilds\",\n      \"order\": 2,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Modify `step_substrate_zones()` to add root oxygenation bonus to base Bouldin penetration depth, clamped to substrate depth, with tracing::debug! output separating base vs ROL contributions\",\n      \"order\": 3,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Add substrate.o2_penetration_depth_cm and substrate.root_oxygenation_bonus_cm to pool snapshot in tracing.rs and KNOWN_POOL_NAMES for delta tracking\",\n      \"order\": 4,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Add stage metrics (substrate.root_oxygenation_bonus_cm, substrate.o2_penetration_depth_cm) to the system:substrate_zones engine stage in engine.rs\",\n      \"order\": 5,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Fix two existing tests (anoxic_water, low_do_high_demand) that now need plant_guilds cleared since default state includes 3g RootFeedingRosette biomass which produces non-zero ROL bonus\",\n      \"order\": 6,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Add 5 unit tests in substrate.rs: rooted_plants_increase_o2_penetration, root_oxygenation_proportional_to_biomass_with_diminishing_returns, floating_plant_biomass_does_not_increase_penetration, zero_root_biomass_yields_zero_oxygenation_bonus, root_oxygenation_uses_named_parameter\",\n      \"order\": 7,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Add 4 integration tests in tests/root_zone_oxygenation.rs: planted_vs_unplanted_diverge_in_penetration_depth (500h), planted_substrate_denitrification_interaction, planted_substrate_nitrification_surface_area, tracing_exposes_root_oxygenation\",\n      \"order\": 8,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Run cargo test (all pass), cargo clippy -- -D warnings (clean), cargo fmt --check (clean)\",\n      \"order\": 9,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"validation_evidence\": [\n    \"All 20 substrate unit tests pass including 5 new ROL-specific tests\",\n    \"All 4 integration tests in root_zone_oxygenation.rs pass including 500-hour planted vs unplanted divergence\",\n    \"Full workspace test suite passes (no regressions across all crates and integration tests)\",\n    \"cargo clippy -- -D warnings produces zero warnings\",\n    \"cargo fmt --check produces no formatting issues\",\n    \"test_rooted_plants_increase_o2_penetration: planted tank has deeper O₂ penetration than unplanted baseline\",\n    \"test_root_oxygenation_proportional_to_biomass_with_diminishing_returns: bonus ratio follows sqrt scaling (3.16× for 10× biomass, not 10×)\",\n    \"test_floating_plant_biomass_does_not_increase_penetration: FastStem guild produces zero ROL bonus\",\n    \"test_zero_root_biomass_yields_zero_oxygenation_bonus: zero biomass yields zero bonus\",\n    \"test_root_oxygenation_uses_named_parameter: doubling rol_rate_cm_per_g doubles the bonus\",\n    \"planted_vs_unplanted_diverge_in_penetration_depth: 500h engine run shows persistent divergence in O₂ penetration\",\n    \"planted_substrate_denitrification_interaction: planted and unplanted tanks diverge in N₂ export\",\n    \"planted_substrate_nitrification_surface_area: planted tank has larger oxic zone volume\"\n  ],\n  \"outstanding_risks\": [\n    \"Root respiration demand (in estimate_substrate_o2_demand_rate) competes with the ROL bonus: at low background O₂ demand, adding rooted plants can paradoxically decrease net penetration because root O₂ consumption outweighs the ROL bonus. This is ecologically defensible (roots do consume O₂) but may surprise users at low decomposer biomass. The integration tests use high decomposer biomass (20g) to ensure ROL dominates, matching realistic mature planted tanks.\",\n    \"The sqrt saturation model is a simplification. Real ROL rates vary by species, root morphology, and sediment redox state. The single parameter rol_rate_cm_per_g cannot capture this heterogeneity but is appropriate for the simulator's guild-based abstraction level.\",\n    \"Pre-existing uncommitted changes to snapshot.rs (chloride_mg_per_l, effective_nitrite_hazard_mg_per_l fields from another worktree) were found and are unrelated to this change but were present during validation.\"\n  ]\n}\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"c7df356c-b043-4147-b116-26c067b5